frecon (statically linked)
==========================

A fast framebuffer console/terminal emulator running on the Linux console.

Prebuilt from Rockchip Buildroot 2021 SDK:
62b414915b frecon: Support setting preferred mode

Using rockchip_rk3036_defconfig with additional configs:
BR2_GCC_VERSION_11_X=y

BR2_PACKAGE_EUDEV=y
BR2_PACKAGE_EUDEV_STATIC=y

BR2_PACKAGE_FRECON=y
BR2_PACKAGE_FRECON_STATIC=y

BR2_PACKAGE_LIBDRM=y
BR2_PACKAGE_LIBDRM_STATIC=y

BR2_PACKAGE_LIBPNG=y
BR2_PACKAGE_LIBPNG_STATIC=y

BR2_PACKAGE_LIBTSM=y
BR2_PACKAGE_LIBTSM_STATIC=y
